; module-definition file for MAXMETER (wxWindows 1.68E, Open 386MAX 9)

NAME	     MAXMETER

DESCRIPTION  'MAXmeter, Open 386MAX'

EXETYPE      WINDOWS

; no CODE line: wlink packs the code segments only without one (else every
; library module is a segment of its own - more than the loader takes)
DATA  PRELOAD MOVEABLE MULTIPLE

STACKSIZE    16384
HEAPSIZE     8192
